      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A worker is a bounded decompilation attempt for one claimed epoch target. The\nworker keeps trying to reach an exact match; the runner owns lifecycle,\nvalidation, checkpointing, best-attempt selection, timeout handling, and final\nclassification."
        }
